[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2642990396","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102531#issuecomment-2642990396","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102531","id":2642990396,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6diNU8","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-07T13:46:22Z","updated_at":"2025-02-07T13:49:10Z","body":"`Font.get_rids()` is `TypedArray` for a single reason, it's a public API, and we do not have `Vector<RID>` exposed to scripting. I suspect most of the use cases are the same.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2642990396/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2643011641","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102531#issuecomment-2643011641","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102531","id":2643011641,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6diSg5","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-07T13:55:12Z","updated_at":"2025-02-07T13:55:12Z","body":"> Font.get_rids() is TypedArray for a single reason, it's a public API, and we do not have Vector<RID> exposed to scripting.\n\nThanks, good to hear this confirmed!\n\nIn the core meeting we estimated that `Font` would probably be better served using `Vector<RID>` internally, to accelerate all its processing functions. `Font.get_rids()` would have to make a copy to `Array` on call. This would be noticeably slower, but probably less important than the acceleration gained for all the other functions.\n\nThough this would of course be up for debate in the PR I'll open for it then :)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2643011641/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2643065453","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102531#issuecomment-2643065453","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102531","id":2643065453,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6difpt","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-07T14:19:46Z","updated_at":"2025-02-07T14:19:46Z","body":"From a cursory glance at headers (i.e. at class members) there aren't really any cases I can find of `TypedArray` that aren't associated with exposed API, there's far more `Array` cases so didn't go through those\n\nIn some cases where we pass data one way (i.e. a method that is fed an `Array`) it might be good to just transfer the data, and that is done in most cases I suspect","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2643065453/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]